-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">112</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">86<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">gpu</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">34,294</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">14,252</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">565.8</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">501w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">12,600</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">500.2</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">501w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">6,209</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">246.5</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">501w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">26,789</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">445.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">501w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">20,989</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">349.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">501w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">12,534</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">208.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">501w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">The ASUS A21 is a mATX case marketed as mid-tower with rear connector support for all cables and headers. Features dual 360mm radiator support but does not support vertical GPU mounting without significant case modifications. Build quality is excellent with clean cable management thanks to daisy-chained fan and ARGB cables. The TRYX Panorama 360 AIO is overkill for the 7800x3d but delivers comparable performance to standard 360mm AIOs with an interesting 6.5&quot; curved monitor display feature. CPU thermals are excellent with low power draw of 86w at stock settings and EXPO memory enabled. GPU performs exceptionally well with the high-end RTX 4090 staying cool under all conditions. This is an aesthetically-focused all-white build that prioritizes looks and cable management over cost-efficiency, but delivers top-tier performance. The rear connector motherboard and matching components create a unique visual design, though the trend is unlikely to gain widespread adoption due to high pricing and limited case selection. Build demonstrates excellent engineering with top-notch performance backing up the premium aesthetic presentation.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">17,626</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:60%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->40<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">205</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">17<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">565.8<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-green\" style=\"width:94%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->6<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">1.13</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">20<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 p