 mATX case marketed as mid-tower with rear connector support for all cables and headers. Features dual 360mm radiator support but does not support vertical GPU mounting without significant case modifications. Build quality is excellent with clean cable management thanks to daisy-chained fan and ARGB cables. The TRYX Panorama 360 AIO is overkill for the 7800x3d but delivers comparable performance to standard 360mm AIOs with an interesting 6.5\\\" curved monitor display feature. CPU thermals are excellent with low power draw of 86w at stock settings and EXPO memory enabled. GPU performs exceptionally well with the high-end RTX 4090 staying cool under all conditions. This is an aesthetically-focused all-white build that prioritizes looks and cable management over cost-efficiency, but delivers top-tier performance. The rear connector motherboard and matching components create a unique visual design, though the trend is unlikely to gain widespread adoption due to high pricing and limited case selection. Build demonstrates excellent engineering with top-notch performance backing up the premium aesthetic presentation.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Builder notes\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$1f\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Performance\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"chi