an aesthetically-focused all-white build that prioritizes looks and cable management over cost-efficiency, but delivers top-tier performance. The rear connector motherboard and matching components create a unique visual design, though the trend is unlikely to gain widespread adoption due to high pricing and limited case selection. Build demonstrates excellent engineering with top-notch performance backing up the premium aesthetic presentation.16:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\",\"children\":\"Builder notes\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\",\"children\":\"$1f\"}]]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Performance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\",\"children\":\"CPU — CB23 Multi\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"17,626\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"60%\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\",\"children\":[\"top \",40,\"%\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-ink\",\"children\":205}],\" pts/w\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",